description: Ship the smallest working product slice with focused verification
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `AGENTS.md`. For direct user-directed work, inspect the existing runtime, implement the owning change, and verify the visible behavior. Do not require a new plan, GitHub Issue, Project item, or synchronized preflight before editing.

Specialist roles in `.cursor/agents/` are opt-in for an explicitly requested managed run. Use one active product slice and the checks that cover its changed behavior; fix CI path selection when unrelated suites delay a routine change.

The record in `docs/agents/pre-implementation-gate.md` is required only when invoking the autonomous runner or orchestrator. Keep payment, access, source-rights, migration, and production changes under focused end-to-end review.
